The files in this directory come from Unitree Robotics' unitree_rl_gym
(https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_gym), commit 276801e:

- policy.onnx is an ONNX export of deploy/pre_train/g1/motion.pt, the
  pretrained G1 locomotion policy (trained in Isaac Gym; PPO with an LSTM actor).
- policy.json and policy-menagerie.json are this repository's policy specs for it.

unitree_rl_gym is released under the BSD 3-Clause licence (see LICENSE). The
repository does not say outright that the trained weights are covered by that
licence, so they are treated as part of it. Check with Unitree before
redistributing them outside this repository.
